ze Your Sleep\n                </h3>\n                <p class=\"mt-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-[#4A2A33]\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-3\">\n                    Get a personalized bedtime and wake up ready for whatever’s ahead, every day.\n                </p>\n                <ul class=\"mt-6 space-y-2.5 text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-4\">\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-4-1\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-check\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-4-1-1\">\n                        </i>\n                        Get a recommended bedtime each night\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-4-2\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-check\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-4-2-1\">\n                        </i>\n                        Track sleep stages and consistency\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-4-3\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-check\" data-kid=\"1-8-1-4-3-1\">\n                        </i>\n                        Wake at the right time with Smart Alarm\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-[#F3EEEA] rounded-[18px] p-10 flex flex-col\" data-kid=\"1-8-2\">\n                <span class=\"self-start h-9 px-3.5 rounded-[6px] bg-[#2A0B14] text-white text-[12px] font-medium tracking-[0.06em] flex items-center\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-1\">\n                    COACHING\n                </span>\n                <h3 class=\"serif mt-8 text-[30px] leading-[1.1] font-normal tracking-[-0.01em]\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-2\">\n                    Meet Your Coach\n                </h3>\n                <p class=\"mt-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-[#4A2A33]\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-3\">\n                    See your daily Recovery score, hit personalized Strain targets, and get AI coaching built on your data.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"mt-auto pt-8 flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-4\">\n                    <img alt=\"Coach Jeremiah Theodore\" class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-4-1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kombai-assets.b-cdn.net/generated_assets/f9b46c42-f591-4385-bfc2-9b6663bcd54f/1ea11b9725244f2587b3227b5fe5edc0.jpg\"/>\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-8-2-4-2\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-4-2-1\">\n                            Coach Jeremiah Theodore\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"text-[12px] text-[#7A5B64]\" data-kid=\"1-8-2-4-2-2\">\n                            Recovery 78% · Green\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-[#F3EEEA] rounded-[18px] p-10 flex flex-col\" data-kid=\"1-8-3\">\n                <span class=\"self-start h-9 px-3.5 rounded-[6px] bg-[#2A0B14] text-white text-[12px] font-medium tracking-[0.06em] flex items-center\" data-kid=\"1-8-3-1\">\n                    HEART HEALTH\n                </span>\n                <h3 class=\"serif mt-8 text-[30px] leading-[1.1] font-normal tracking-[-0.01em]\" data-kid=\"1-8-3-2\">\n                    Monitor Your Heart Health\n                </h3>\n                <p class=\"mt-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-[#4A2A33]\" data-kid=\"1-8-3-3\">\n                    Take ECG readings with Heart Screener, get daily Blood Pressure Insights, and receive alerts when something’s off.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"mt-auto pt-8 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-center\" data-kid=\"1-8-3-4\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-[#FAF8F6] rounded-[10px] py-3\" data-kid=\"1-8-3-4-1\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[18px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-8-3-4-1-1\">\n                            52\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"text-[10px] text-[#7A