 data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"value proposition description text\">\n                    StorePilot finds the friction costing you sales and helps your team fix it faster.\n                </p>\n                <ul class=\"mt-7 space-y-3.5 text-[13.5px] text-[#2A0B14]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4\" data-name=\"value prop benefit list\">\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"connect store benefit row\">\n                        <span class=\"mt-0.5 grid size-5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#F8F38A] text-[12px] text-[#2A0B14]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"benefit checkmark badge\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-check\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                        Connect Shopify or WooCommerce in minutes\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"performance insight benefit row\">\n                        <span class=\"mt-0.5 grid size-5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#F8F38A] text-[12px] text-[#2A0B14]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"benefit checkmark badge\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-check\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                        See checkout, product, and campaign performance\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4-3\" data-name=\"launch experiment benefit row\">\n                        <span class=\"mt-0.5 grid size-5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#F8F38A] text-[12px] text-[#2A0B14]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4-3-1\" data-name=\"benefit checkmark badge\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-check\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4-3-1-1\" data-name=\"checkmark