-[13px] font-medium\" data-act=\"size\" data-id=\"music\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-4-5-1-3\" data-s=\"L\" title=\"180–220 mm\">L</button></div>\n<button class=\"flex-1 h-11 rounded-full bg-[#FAF8F6] text-[#2A0B14] text-[14px] font-medium flex items-center justify-center gap-2\" data-act=\"add\" data-id=\"music\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-4-5-2\">Add Music to cart <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-4-5-2-1\"></i></button>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-[11px] opacity-70\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-4-6\">Size M fits wrists 150–190 mm</p>\n</div></article></div>\n<div class=\"mx-[72px] mt-14 pt-10 border-t border-[#2A0B14]/10 flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-3-3\" data-name=\"lineup footer row\">\n<a class=\"lineup-link serif text-[30px] font-medium flex items-center gap-4 hover:gap-6 transition-all\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2\" data-name=\"compare all bands link\" href=\"#compare\">Compare all five <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right text-[26px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2-1\"></i></a>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- ═════════ QUIZ — \"three questions\" stage sheet ═════════ -->\n<section class=\"relative mx-4 mt-32 h-[880px] rounded-[28px] overflow-hidden bg-[#F8F38A]\" data-kid=\"1-4\" data-name=\"find your band quiz section\" id=\"quiz\">\n<div class=\"absolute z-10 top-14 left-[72px] right-[72px] flex items-center justify-between pointer-events-none text-[#2A0B14]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-4-1\" data-name=\"quiz overlay header\" data-reason=\"text colour switched by stage script\" id=\"quizOverlay\">\n<span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold tracking-[0.34em] uppercase\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"quiz eyebrow\">✦  Find your band · three questions</span>\n<span class=\"serif italic text-[24px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2\" data-name=\"quiz overlay title\">Two bands worth comparing.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"absolute z-10 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 right-10 flex flex-col items-end gap-4 text-[#2A0B14]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-4-2\" data-name=\"quiz progress indicator\" data-reason=\"active dot and colour set by stage script\" id=\"quizProg\">\n<button class=\"prog-dot active serif text-[20px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"question 1 progress dot\" data-stage=\"0\">01</button>\n<button class=\"prog-dot serif text-[20px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"question 2 progress\" data-stage=\"1\">02</button>\n<button class=\"prog-dot serif text-[20px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-3\" data-name=\"question 3 progress\" data-stage=\"2\">03</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0\" data-kid=\"1-4-3\" data-name=\"quiz stages container\">\n<!-- stage 01 -->\n<article class=\"stage stage-active absolute inset-0 bg-[#F8F38A] text-[#2A0B14]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1\" data-name=\"question 1 stage\">\n<span class=\"absolute top-[108px] left-[56px] serif text-[340px] leading-[0.78] font-medium tracking-[-0.06em]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-1\" data-name=\"giant stage numeral\">01<span class=\"text-[60px] align-top ml-3 opacity-50 tracking-normal\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-1-1\">/03</span></span>\n<div class=\"absolute right-[150px] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[520px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-2\" data-name=\"question body\">\n<p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.28em] uppercase opacity-60\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"question count\">Question 1 of 3</p>\n<h3 class=\"mt-4 serif text-[72px] leading-[0.95] font-medium tracking-[-0.03em]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"question headline\">What will you use it for most?</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-5 text-[16px] leading-[1.55] max-w-[400px] opacity-80\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-2-3\" data-name=\"question helper text\">Pick the one that fills most of your week. Battery is usually the deciding row.</p>\n<div class=\"qopts mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-2\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-k=\"use\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-2-4\" data-name=\"answer options\" data-reason=\"rendered by quiz script\"><button class=\"h-12 px-5 rounded-full text-[15px] font-medium border-[1.5px] transition border-[#2A0B14]/40 hover:bg-[#2A0B14]/5\" data-act=\"q\" data-k=\"use\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"sleep answer option button\" data-v=\"sleep\">Sleep</button><button class=\"h-12 px-5 rounded-full text-[15px] font-medium border-[1.5px] transition bg-[#2A0B14] text-white border-[#2A0B14]\" data-act=\"q\" data-k=\"use\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"training answer option button\" data-v=\"training\">Training</button><button class=\"h-12 px-5 rounded-full text-[15px] font-medium border-[1.5px] transition border-[#2A0B14]/40 hover:bg-[#2A0B14]/5\" data-act=\"q\" data-k=\"use\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-2-4-3\" data-name=\"music on runs answer option button\" data-v=\"music\">Music on runs</button><button class=\"h-12 px-5 rounded-full text-[15px] font-medium border-[1.5px] transition border-[#2A0B14]/40 hover:bg-[#2A0B14]/5\" data-act=\"q\" data-k=\"use\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-2-4-4\" data-name=\"long days outdoors answer option button\" data-v=\"endurance\">Long days outdoors</button></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"absolute left-[72px] bottom-[120px] w-[520px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3\" data-name=\"battery life bar chart\">\n<p class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold tracking-[0.24em] uppercase opacity-60 mb-4\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-1\" data-name=\"chart label\">Battery life, in days</p>\n<div class=\"flex items-end gap-4 h-[150px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-2\" data-name=\"battery bars\">\n<div class=\"flex-1 h-full flex flex-col justify-end items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-2-1\"><div class=\"bar-fill w-full h-full rounded-t-[10px] bg-[#2A0B14]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-2-1-1\" style=\"--h:.36\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"flex-1 h-full flex flex-col justify-end items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-2-2\"><div class=\"bar-fill w-full h-full rounded-t-[10px] bg-[#2A0B14]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-2-2-1\" style=\"--h:.5\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"flex-1 h-full flex flex-col justify-end items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-2-3\"><div class=\"bar-fill w-full h-full rounded-t-[10px] bg-[#2A0B14]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-2-3-1\" style=\"--h:.71\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"flex-1 h-full flex flex-col justify-end items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-2-4\"><div class=\"bar-fill w-full h-full rounded-t-[10px] bg-[#2A0B14]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-2-4-1\" style=\"--h:.43\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"flex-1 h-full flex flex-col justify-end items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-2-5\"><div class=\"bar-fill w-full h-full rounded-t-[10px] bg-[#C8553D]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-2-5-1\" style=\"--h:1\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-3 grid grid-cols-5 gap-4 text-center\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-3\" data-name=\"bar labels\">\n<p class=\"text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-3-1\"><span class=\"serif text-[22px] font-medium block\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-3-1-1\">5</span>Lite</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-3-2\"><span class=\"serif text-[22px] font-medium block\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-3-2-1\">7</span>Smart</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-3-3\"><span class=\"serif text-[22px] font-medium block\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-3-3-1\">10</span>Pro</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-3-4\"><span class=\"serif text-[22px] font-medium block\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-3-4-1\">6</span>Music</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-3-5\"><span class=\"serif text-[22px] font-medium block\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-3-3-5-1\">14</span>Ultra</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<!-- stage 02 -->\n<article class=\"stage absolute inset-0 bg-[#C8553D] text-[#FAF8F6]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2\" data-name=\"question 2 stage\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(100%, 0%) translate(4224px, 0px);\">\n<span class=\"absolute top-[108px] left-[56px] serif text-[340px] leading-[0.78] font-medium tracking-[-0.06em]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-1\" data-name=\"giant stage numeral\">02<span class=\"text-[60px] align-top ml-3 opacity-50 tracking-normal\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-1-1\">/03</span></span>\n<div class=\"absolute right-[150px] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[520px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-2\" data-name=\"question body\">\n<p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.28em] uppercase opacity-70\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"question count\">Question 2 of 3</p>\n<h3 class=\"mt-4 serif text-[72px] leading-[0.95] font-medium tracking-[-0.03em]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"question headline\">How do you feel about wearing it overnight?</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-5 text-[16px] leading-[1.55] max-w-[400px] opacity-85\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"question helper text\">Sleep stages need it on your wrist all night. Every gram counts at 3 am.</p>\n<div class=\"qopts mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-2\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-k=\"night\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-2-4\" data-name=\"answer options\" data-reason=\"rendered by quiz script\"><button class=\"h-12 px-5 rounded-full text-[15px] font-medium border-[1.5px] transition bg-[#FAF8F6] text-[#2A0B14] border-[#FAF8F6]\" data-act=\"q\" data-k=\"night\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"lightest band answer option button\" data-v=\"light\">I want the lightest band</button><button class=\"h-12 px-5 rounded-full text-[15px] font-medium border-[1.5px] transition border-[#FAF8F6]/50 hover:bg-white/10\" data-act=\"q\" data-k=\"night\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"weight doesn't matter answer option button\" data-v=\"any\">Weight doesn't matter</button></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"absolute left-[72px] bottom-[110px] flex items-center gap-8\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-3\" data-name=\"weight gauge group\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-[230px] h-[230px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"weight gauge\" viewbox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n<circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" fill=\"none\" r=\"42\" stroke=\"rgba(250,248,246,0.22)\" stroke-width=\"9\"></circle>\n<circle class=\"gauge-fg\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" fill=\"none\" r=\"42\" stroke=\"#FAF8F6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"9\" transform=\"rotate(-90 50 50)