</div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mx-auto mt-6 flex max-w-page flex-col gap-3 px-8 text-[14px] text-ink-soft sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\" data-kid=\"3-2-8\">\n      <p data-kid=\"3-2-8-1\">Also in the lineup: <span class=\"font-medium text-ink\" data-kid=\"3-2-8-1-1\">Smart</span>, with an always-on display, and <span class=\"font-medium text-ink\" data-kid=\"3-2-8-1-2\">Music</span>, with 500 songs on your wrist.</p>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"font-medium text-ink underline underline-offset-4 transition hover:opacity-70\" data-kid=\"3-2-8-2\">See all five bands</a>\n    </div>\n\n\n    <!-- ============ 7. CTA (unchanged CtaBanner) ============ -->\n    <div class=\"reveal mx-4 mt-28\" data-kid=\"3-2-9\">\n      <section class=\"grid overflow-hidden rounded-section bg-ink text-white lg:grid-cols-[1fr_480px]\" data-kid=\"3-2-9-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center bg-ink px-6 py-14 text-white lg:px-[80px] lg:py-20\" data-kid=\"3-2-9-1-1\">\n          <h2 class=\"max-w-[560px] font-serif text-[40px] leading-[1.08] font-medium lg:text-heading\" data-kid=\"3-2-9-1-1-1\">You pay for the membership. The band comes with it.</h2>\n          <p class=\"mt-5 max-w-[480px] text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-white/75\" data-kid=\"3-2-9-1-1-2\">Plans start at $199 a year with Lite or Smart included at $0. One yearly charge, no separate bill for the hardware.</p>\n          <div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"3-2-9-1-1-3\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex h-[52px] items-center rounded-full bg-accent px-6 text-[15px] font-medium text-ink transition hover:bg-accent-hover\" data-kid=\"3-2-9-1-1-3-1\">How membership works</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex h-[52px] items-center rounded-full border border-white/40 px-6 text-[15px] font-medium text-white transition hover:bg-white hover:text-ink\" data-kid=\"3-2-9-1-1-3-2\">Compare plans</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://kombai-assets.b-cdn.net/generated_assets/f9b46c42-f591-4385-bfc2-9b6663bcd54f/5c5f0134e1a34895b7cb2cd92d3ecde7.jpg\" alt=\"Aero Fit band in its open box with a welcome card\" class=\"h-[320px] w-full object-cover lg:h-full\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"__crawlAsset&amp;&amp;__crawlAsset(this)\" data-kid=\"3-2-9-1-2\">\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- FOOTER (from Field Guide) -->\n  <footer class=\"relative mx-4 mt-28 mb-4 rounded-section overflow-hidden bg-[#2A0B14] text-[#FAF8F6] pt-20 pb-10 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_15%_22%,rgba(248,243,138,0.07)_0%,transparent_38%),radial-gradient(circle_at_85%_78%,rgba(107,123,78,0.12)_0%,transparent_40%)]\" data-kid=\"1-6\" data-name=\"site footer\">\n<span class=\"fshape starshape absolute top-10 left-14 w-[60px] h-[60px] bg-[#F8F38A] opacity-25 pointer-events-none\" data-depth=\"-30\" data-kid=\"1-6-1\" data-name=\"floating star shape\"></span>\n<span class=\"fshape absolute top-28 right-28 w-[90px] h-[90px] rounded-full bg-[#C8553D] opacity-20 pointer-events-none\" data-depth=\"-60\" data-kid=\"1-6-2\" data-name=\"floating circle shape\"></span>\n<span class=\"fshape sparkle absolute bottom-36 left-[34%] w-11 h-11 bg-[#A3B47F] opacity-30 pointer-events-none\" data-depth=\"-45\" data-kid=\"1-6-3\" data-name=\"floating sparkle shape\"></span>\n<div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-8\" data-kid=\"1-6-4\">\n<div class=\"grid gap-10 text-[15px] sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-[1.6fr_1fr_1fr_1fr_1fr] lg:gap-7\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3\" data-name=\"footer columns\" id=\"footCols\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-1\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-4\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-1-1\"><img alt=\"Aero Fit logo\" class=\"w-9 h-9\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-1-1-1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/.kombai/canvas/assets/aerofit-mark.svg\"><span class=\"font-serif whitespace-nowrap text-[26px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-1-1-2\">Aero Fit</span></div>\n<p class=\"text-[13px] italic opacity-60 max-w-[30ch] leading-[1.6]\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-1-2\" data-name=\"footer blurb\">Aero Fit features are intended for general wellness and fitness purposes. They are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.</p>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-2\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#F8F38A] mb-4\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-2-1\">Shop</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 opacity-85\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-2-2\"><li data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-2-2-1\"><a class=\"hover:text-[#F8F38A]\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-2-2-1-1\" href=\"#\">Aero Fit Lite</a></li><li data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-2-2-2\"><a class=\"hover:text-[#F8F38A]\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-2-2-2-1\" href=\"#\">Aero Fit Smart</a></li><li data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-2-2-3\"><a class=\"hover:text-[#F8F38A]\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-2-2-3-1\" href=\"#\">Aero Fit Pro</a></li><li data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-2-2-4\"><a class=\"hover:text-[#F8F38A]\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-2-2-4-1\" href=\"#\">Aero Fit Music</a></li><li data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-2-2-5\"><a class=\"hover:text-[#F8F38A]\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-2-2-5-1\" href=\"#\">Aero Fit Ultra</a></li></ul></div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-3\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#F8F38A] mb-4\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-3-1\">Memberships</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 opacity-85\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-3-2\"><li data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-3-2-1\"><a class=\"hover:text-[#F8F38A]\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-3-2-1-1\" href=\"#\">Aero Fit One</a></li><li data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-3-2-2\"><a class=\"hover:text-[#F8F38A]\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-3-2-2-1\" href=\"#\">Aero Fit Peak</a></li><li data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-3-2-3\"><a class=\"hover:text-[#F8F38A]\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-3-2-3-1\" href=\"#\">Aero Fit Life</a></li><li data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-3-2-4\"><a class=\"hover:text-[#F8F38A]\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-3-2-4-1\" href=\"#\">Compare plans</a></li></ul></div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-4\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#F8F38A] mb-4\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-4-1\">Support</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 opacity-85\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-4-2\"><li data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-4-2-1\"><a class=\"hover:text-[#F8F38A]\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-4-2-1-1\" href=\"#\">Help Center</a></li><li data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-4-2-2\"><a class=\"hover:text-[#F8F38A]\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-4-2-2-1\" href=\"#\">Sizing guide</a></li><li data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-4-2-3\"><a class=\"hover:text-[#F8F38A]\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-4-2-3-1\" href=\"#\">Accessories</a></li><li data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-4-2-4\"><a class=\"hover:text-[#F8F38A]\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-4-2-4-1\" href=\"#\">Download App</a></li></ul></div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-5\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#F8F38A] mb-4\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-5-1\">Connect</p>\n<div class=\"flex gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-5-2\" data-name=\"social icons\">\n<a aria-label=\"Instagram\" class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white/12 flex items-center justify-center text-[18px] hover:bg-[#F8F38A] hover:text-[#2A0B14] transition\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-5-2-1\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"ti ti-brand-instagram\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-5-2-1-1\"></i></a>\n<a aria-label=\"YouTube\" class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white/12 flex items-center justify-center text-[18px] hover:bg-[#F8F38A] hover:text-[#2A0B14] transition\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-5-2-2\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"ti ti-brand-youtube\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-5-2-2-1\"></i></a>\n<a aria-label=\"Podcast\" class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white/12 flex items-center justify-center text-[18px] hover:bg-[#F8F38A] hover:text-[#2A0B14] transition\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-5-2-3\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"ti ti-microphone\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-5-2-3-1\"></i></a>\n<a aria-label=\"Contact\" class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white/12 flex items-center justify-center text-[18px] hover:bg-[#F8F38A] hover:text-[#2A0B14] transition\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-5-2-4\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"ti ti-mail\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-5-2-4-1\"></i></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-white/15 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:items-center text-[13px] italic opacity-70\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-4\" data-name=\"fine print row\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-6-4-4-1\">© 2026 Aero Fit · membership plans are billed annually with a 12-month minimum term</span>\n<div class=\"flex gap-6\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-4-2\"><a data-kid=\"1-6-4-4-2-1\" href=\"#\">Terms &amp; Conditions</a><a data-kid=\"1-6-4-4-2-2\" href=\"#\">Privacy Policy</a><a data-kid=\"1-6-4-4-2-3\" href=\"#\">Accessibility</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Design-notes toggle (mock only) -->\n\n\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const root = document.documentElement;\n  const reduce = matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  if (reduce) root.classList.add('rm');\n\n  const clamp = (v, a = 0, b = 1) => Math.min(b, Math.max(a, v));\n  const range = (p, a, b) => clamp((p - a) / (b - a));\n  const ease = (t) => 1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 3);\n  const isDesktop = () => innerWidth >= 1024;\n\n  /** 0 → 1 while a tall wrapper's sticky stage is pinned. */\n  const pinProgress = (wrap) => {\n    if (reduce) return 1;\n    const total = wrap.offsetHeight - innerHeight;\n    return total > 0 ? clamp(-wrap.getBoundingClientRect().top / total) : 1;\n  };\n\n  /* ---------- smooth scroll (Lenis) ---------- */\n  let lenis = null;\n  if (!reduce && window.Lenis) {\n    lenis = new Lenis({ lerp: 0.1, smoothWheel: true });\n    const raf = (t) => { lenis.raf(t); requestAnimationFrame(raf); };\n    requestAnimationFrame(raf);\n    document.querySelectorAll('a[href^=\"#\"]').forEach((a) => {\n      const id = a.getAttribute('href');\n      if (id.length > 1) a.addEventListener('click', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); lenis.scrollTo(id, { offset: -90 }); });\n    });\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- one-shot reveals (same as <Reveal>) ---------- */\n  const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => entries.forEach((en) => {\n    if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.dataset.visible = 'true'; io.unobserve(en.target); }\n  }), { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -40px 0px' });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach((el) => io.observe(el));\n\n  /* ---------- elements ---------- */\n  const hero = document.getElementById('hero');\n  const heroImg = document.getElementById('heroImg');\n  const heroCopy = document.getElementById('heroCopy');\n  const heroCard = document.getElementById('heroCard');\n\n  const collage = document.getElementById('collage');\n  const cards = [...document.querySelectorAll('[data-card]')];\n  const collageText = document.getElementById('collageText');\n\n  const score = document.getElementById('score');\n  const scoreTitle = document.getElementById('scoreTitle');\n  const scoreStat = document.getElementById('scoreStat');\n  const scoreNum = document.getElementById('scoreNum');\n  const scoreArc = document.getElementById('scoreArc');\n  const scoreBand = document.getElementById('scoreBand');\n  const chips = [...document.querySelectorAll('[data-chip]')];\n\n  const day = document.getElementById('day');\n  const dayFill = document.getElementById('dayFill');\n  const moments = [...document.querySelectorAll('[data-moment]')];\n\n  const blocks = [...document.querySelectorAll('[data-block]')];\n\n  const scoresPin = document.getElementById('scoresPin');\n  const track = document.getElementById('track');\n  const slides = [...track.querySelectorAll('[data-slide]')];\n  const easeInOut = (t) => (t < 0.5 ? 4 * t * t * t : 1 - Math.pow(-2 * t + 2, 3) / 2);\n  let scTarget = 0, scCur = 0, scRunning = false, scStep = 0;\n  const applyScores = (pos) => {\n    track.style.transform = `translate3d(${(-pos * scStep).toFixed(2)}px, 0, 0)`;\n    slides.forEach((s, j) => {\n      const d = Math.min(1, Math.abs(pos - j));\n      s.style.opacity = (1 - d * 0.55).toFixed(3);\n      s.style.transform = `scale(${(1 - d * 0.04).toFixed(4)})`;\n    });\n  };\n  const scoresTick = () => {\n    scStep = slides[1].offsetLeft - slides[0].offsetLeft;\n    scCur += (scTarget - scCur) * 0.09;\n    if (Math.abs(scTarget - scCur) < 0.0004) scCur = scTarget;\n    applyScores(scCur);\n    if (scCur !== scTarget) requestAnimationFrame(scoresTick); else scRunning = false;\n  };\n\n  /* ---------- per-frame scroll scene ---------- */\n  function update() {\n    const vh = innerHeight;\n\n    // 1 · Hero: photo drifts + zooms, copy lifts away, panel pulls in.\n    const hp = reduce ? 0 : clamp(scrollY / hero.offsetHeight);\n    heroImg.style.transform = `translate3d(0, ${hp * 14}%, 0) scale(${1 + hp * 0.1})`;\n    heroCopy.style.transform = `translate3d(0, ${-hp * 90}px, 0)`;\n    heroCopy.style.opacity = 1 - range(hp, 0.15, 0.6);\n    heroCard.style.transform = `translate3d(0, ${-hp * 160}px, 0)`;\n    hero.style.clipPath = `inset(0 ${hp * 32}px round 28px)`;\n\n    // 2 · Collage: cards fan out from behind the headline, then keep drifting up.\n    const cp = pinProgress(collage);\n    const stageW = collage.clientWidth, stageH = vh;\n    const sizeK = stageW < 640 ? 0.62 : stageW < 1024 ? 0.82 : 1;\n    const spreadK = stageW < 640 ? 1.25 : 1;\n    const inP = ease(range(cp, 0, 0.45));\n    const outP = range(cp, 0.5, 1);\n    cards.forEach((c, i) => {\n      const x = +c.dataset.x / 100 * stageW * spreadK;\n      const y = +c.dataset.y / 100 * stageH;\n      const s = +c.dataset.s;\n      c.style.width = `${+c.dataset.w * sizeK}px`;\n      c.style.height = `${+c.dataset.h * sizeK}px`;\n      const k = inP + outP * 0.3 * s;\n      const lift = outP * 220 * s;\n      c.style.transform = `translate(-50%, -50%) translate3d(${x * k}px, ${y * k - lift}px, 0) scale(${0.5 + 0.5 * inP})`;\n      c.style.opacity = clamp(range(cp, 0.02 * i, 0.25 + 0.02 * i)) * (1 - range(cp, 0.85, 1) * 0.7);\n      c.style.zIndex = Math.round(s * 10);\n    });\n    collageText.style.opacity = range(cp, 0, 0.15) * (1 - range(cp, 0.82, 1));\n    collageText.style.transform = `translate3d(0, ${(1 - range(cp, 0, 0.2)) * 30 - outP * 40}px, 0)`;\n\n    // 3 · Score: title out → number counts up + arc fills + band rises → inputs pop in.\n    const sp = pinProgress(score);\n    const tOut = range(sp, 0.06, 0.2);\n    scoreTitle.style.opacity = 1 - tOut;\n    scoreTitle.style.transform = `translate3d(0, ${-24 * tOut}px, 0)`;\n    const sIn = range(sp, 0.16, 0.3);\n    scoreStat.style.opacity = sIn;\n    scoreStat.style.transform = `translate3d(0, ${(1 - sIn) * 24}px, 0)`;\n    const fill = ease(range(sp, 0.2, 0.62));\n    scoreNum.textContent = Math.round(82 * fill);\n    scoreArc.style.strokeDashoffset = 100 - 82 * fill;\n    // Disk centre sits on the bottom edge when risen (50%), starts well below (100%).\n    scoreBand.style.transform = `translate3d(-50%, ${50 + (1 - ease(range(sp, 0.05, 0.55))) * 50}%, 0)`;\n    chips.forEach((ch, i) => {\n      const cpi = ease(range(sp, 0.62 + i * 0.05, 0.76 + i * 0.05));\n      ch.style.opacity = cpi;\n      ch.style.transform = `translate3d(0, ${(1 - cpi) * 24}px, 0) scale(${0.94 + cpi * 0.06})`;\n    });\n\n    // 4 · Scores: vertical scroll sets a target; scoresTick() glides the track toward it.\n    if (isDesktop() && !reduce) {\n      const raw = range(pinProgress(scoresPin), 0.05, 0.95) * (slides.length - 1);\n      const k = Math.min(Math.floor(raw), slides.length - 2);\n      const f = raw - k;\n      // Soft hold on each card: half linear, half ease-in-out, so it never fully stops.\n      scTarget = k + (f * 0.5 + easeInOut(f) * 0.5);\n      if (!scRunning) { scRunning = true; requestAnimationFrame(scoresTick); }\n    } else {\n      track.style.transform = '';\n    }\n\n    // 5 · Day: line draws across, moments light up in turn.\n    const dp = isDesktop() ? pinProgress(day) : 1;\n    const drawn = range(dp, 0.05, 0.9);\n    dayFill.style.transform = `scaleX(${drawn})`;\n    moments.forEach((m, i) => {\n      const on = drawn >= i / moments.length - 0.001 || !isDesktop();\n      m.style.opacity = on ? 1 : 0.35;\n      // Only the current moment shows its photo: it wipes down from the dot, then lifts away as the next one starts.\n      const local = drawn * moments.length - i;\n      const last = i === moments.length - 1;\n      let v = (i === 0 ? 1 : range(local, 0, 0.18)) * (last ? 1 : 1 - range(local, 0.9, 1.02));\n      if (!isDesktop()) v = 1;\n      const shot = m.querySelector('[data-shot]');\n      shot.style.clipPath = `inset(0 0 ${(1 - ease(v)) * 100}% 0 round 20px)`;\n      shot.firstElementChild.style.transform = `scale(${1.12 - 0.12 * ease(v)})`;\n    });\n\n    // 6 · Bands: each block holds still at the bottom while the next slides over it.\n    blocks.forEach((b, i) => {\n      const next = blocks[i + 1];\n      if (!reduce && isDesktop()) {\n        b.style.top = `${Math.min(0, vh - b.offsetHeight - 24)}px`;\n      } else {\n        b.style.top = '';\n      }\n      if (!next) return;\n      const cover = isDesktop() && !reduce ? clamp(1 - next.getBoundingClientRect().top / vh) : 0;\n      b.style.transform = `scale(${1 - cover * 0.04})`;\n      const shade = b.querySelector('[data-shade]');\n      if (shade) shade.style.opacity = cover * 0.4;\n    });\n  }\n\n  let ticking = false;\n  const onScroll = () => { if (!ticking) { ticking = true; requestAnimationFrame(() => { update(); ticking = false; }); } };\n  if (lenis) lenis.on('scroll', onScroll);\n  addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });\n  addEventListener('resize', onScroll);\n  addEventListener('load', update);\n  update();\n\n  /* ---------- 4 · Score carousel (touch / small screens) ---------- */\n  track.addEventListener('scroll', () => {\n    if (isDesktop()) return;\n    const mid = track.scrollLeft + track.clientWidth / 2;\n    slides.forEach((s) => {\n      const d = Math.min(1, Math.abs(s.offsetLeft + s.offsetWidth / 2 - mid) / s.offsetWidth);\n      s.style.opacity = 1 - d * 0.6;\n      s.style.transform = `scale(${1 - d * 0.04})`;\n    });\n  }, { passive: true });\n\n  /* ---------- design notes toggle ---------- */\n  const notesBtn = document.getElementById('notesBtn');\n  notesBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const on = document.body.classList.toggle('show-notes');\n    notesBtn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', on);\n    notesBtn.querySelector('span').textContent = on ? 'Hide design notes' : 'Show design notes';\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n",
